<title>CANADA: DBRS says puts Abitibi-Price under review.</title>
<headline>DBRS says puts Abitibi-Price under review.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dominion Bond Rating Service said on Friday that it is placing Abititi-Price Inc under review with developing implications after news of Abitibi's proposed merger with Stone-Consolidated Corp.</p>
<p>&quot;Our initial interpretation is that the merger will not lead to any rating changes,&quot; DBRS said in a statement.</p>
<p>The two companies have similar financial profiles and the merger will have little impact on the key credit quality ratios, the rating agency said.</p>
<p>The stock-swap transaction would create the world's biggest newsprint maker.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
</text>
